The [[Goobling]] is a [[Pet]] that can only be obtained by purchasing the [[It's Slime Time!]] skill, or in the shop once [[It's Slime Time!]] is in the character's possession. The [[Goobling]] is essentially a tiny [[Goobert]]. It has the same type of effect, healing when items next to it are triggered, although it is one quarter the size, has two fewer {{icon/star}} slots, requires fewer activations per trigger, and heals less. Two [[Goobling]]s combine into a [[Goobert]], which is required in order to craft anything further.
